# Goals from Home on his own goals (the stand-in passes /goals through; its writes never reach hex):
# Watching and the projects, one opened, a watch with its earlier checks and Stop watching, a
# reached goal with Not what I asked and Undo, one hex works on with Not needed and Add to this
# goal, and one waiting on him. The ids are his as of Nov 15; a reached goal leaves after a week.
launch /
tap hex-tab-goals
shoot goals
tap goals-more-watching
shoot goals-watching
tap goals-project-iikb
shoot goals-project-open
scroll goals-project-iikb
shoot goals-scrolled
launch /goals/w/edd-keeper
shoot watch
tap watch-earlier
shoot watch-earlier
tap watch-stop
shoot watch-stopped
launch /goals/t-1001
shoot goal-reached
tap goal-reopen
shoot goal-reopened
tap goal-reopened-undo
shoot goal-undone
launch /goals/t-1036
shoot goal-working
tap goal-drop
shoot goal-dropped
type goal-field Two rooms are fine if it's cheaper
shoot goal-typing
launch /goals/t-1038
shoot goal-needs
